# OTS project handoff

Saved 2026-09-30. Repo `OmarTaherSaad/OTS`, branch `master` = `origin/master` at `5934b83`. Live site: https://omartahersaad.com/. Owner: Omar Taher Saad.

This workspace is the personal site only. There is no Tauri app and no `tools/ots-assistant/` here. Launch checklists for the separate product live in `OmarTaherSaad/lots`, not this repo.

## Use Cases

- Any change to the public site, contact form, LinkedIn experience block, or production deploy.
- Picking up after a previous chat. Recent work is already on `master`.

## Stack and layout

- Laravel 12, PHP platform locked to **8.2.33** (`composer.json` `config.platform`). Do not let Composer pull Symfony 8 / PHP 8.3-only packages. Production is Hostinger `~/public_html`.
- Frontend: Vite 7, Vue 3, Tailwind 4, Alpine, Bootstrap 5. `fs-extra` is a direct devDependency because `@tsparticles/engine`'s install script imports it; `npm ci` fails without it.
- `npm` `overrides` pin transitive CVE packages. Do not drop them to "clean up" the lockfile.
- Homepage: `MainController::index`. `config('app.landing_v2')` (`LANDING_V2`) chooses `landing.home` vs `home`. Landing partials: `resources/views/landing/partials/`. `.env.example` sets `LANDING_V2=true`.
- Older landing work sits on `feature/landing-v2-vibrant-redesign` (not merged). Do not assume that branch is production.

## Deploy

Push to `master` runs `.github/workflows/deployToProduction.yml`: `npm ci`, Vite build, force-push branch `deploy` (includes `public/build`), SSH to Hostinger, run tracked `deploy.sh`. `deploy.sh` resets to `origin/deploy`, installs PHP deps, caches, migrates, health-checks, resets opcache. It used to be gitignored; it is tracked on purpose. Do not commit `.env`, `public/hot`, or `.cursor/mcp.json`.

## Contact form

Rule detail: `.cursor/rules/contact-form-spam.mdc`. Tests: `tests/Unit/ContactFormGuardTest.php`.

- `POST contact` is throttled `3,1`. Guard: reCAPTCHA v3 action `contact`, score `>= config('contact.recaptcha_min_score')`, honeypot `company_url`, encrypted `form_ts` 3s–1h, max URL count.
- Mail the admin only (`CONTACT_ADMIN_EMAIL`, default `ots.for.work@gmail.com`). No auto-reply to the submitter.
- Do not print `contact@` in HTML or Reply-To. Do not mention `otscommunity.com` (old domain).
- 2026-09-28: junk in `contact@omartahersaad.com` was mostly cold mail, newsletters, one phishing mail, and one real Google security mail. Hardening the form does not stop mailbox spam that never hits the form. Outlook `omartahersaad@outlook.com` spam is outside this app.

## LinkedIn experience

Not live-scraped. Apify was removed. Source is an official LinkedIn data export (`Positions.json`, `Education.json`).

- Config: `config/linkedin.php`. Sync: `php artisan linkedin:sync-experience`.
- Cache: `storage/app/linkedin/experience.json`. Seed: `resources/data/linkedin-profile.json`.
- Curated blurbs live in `enrichments`, keyed `{company-slug}|{role-slug}`. Scrapes often omit descriptions; do not delete enrichments when syncing.

## Local-only secret

`.cursor/mcp.json` is gitignored. It holds the Hostinger email MCP bearer. Never commit it, never paste the token into a rule, commit, or chat summary.

## Constraints

- Composer platform stays PHP 8.2 until Hostinger is upgraded.
- Contact mail never goes to the submitter and never hard-codes an inbox.
- LinkedIn copy comes from the export plus `config/linkedin.php` enrichments.
- `deploy.sh` stays tracked and is what CI runs on the server.

